  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increase Public Sphere through  the Promotion of a Philanthropic Ecosystem Approach</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to pilot the approach of philanthropic ecosystem to better enhance the roles and effectiveness of the non-profit sector in promoting equal, inclusive, and sustainable development. This would help generate new narrative on civil society to strengthen its roles, capabilities, and impact</narrative>
